  :adr/decision-summary
  "{:trigger \"owner request: 'Svelte は全て cljs reframe, reagent に refactor. ただ kotoba-lang/mangaka, genko, や ai-gftd-mangaka, app-aozora の manga などに manga 関係が散らばっているので、それらの依存や重複も確認して'\",
    :research {:agent-a-svelte-cljs-precedent \"ADR-2607131400 explicitly rejects wholesale apps/web rewrite; its own gate (no cljc Dapr/ConnectRPC/Lexical replacement) was already dissolved by addendum 3's finding that those were dead code, not load-bearing. Established migration pattern (kami-engine-sdk, genko) is cljc-SSoT-plus-thin-host-delegation, NOT a reagent/re-frame UI-shell rewrite — that step is explicitly last/lowest-priority in both precedents\",
                :agent-b-aozora-canonical-editor \"mangaka.gftd.ai retirement (ADR-2607071100) only retired the hosted URL (301 -> aozora.app/studio); ai-gftd-mangaka's CLJ engine lives on, actively committed through 2026-07-13. Canonical editor = app-aozora /studio (cljs) + kami-genko (doc model) + ai-gftd-mangaka (layout/gen backend). Canonical viewer = kotoba-lang/manga-viewer (pure cljc, viewer-only). ghosthacker's own Svelte editor is an undocumented THIRD independent implementation for the same Ghost Hacker IP, never compared against the canonical path by any ADR\",
                :agent-c-kami-mangaka-clj-audit \"manifest/west.yml already clean (zero -clj entries, GitHub already renamed). The only real duplication is 5 orphaned untracked local dirs (kami-mangaka-{page,reader,render,scene,text}-clj/) from before the renames, safe to delete (superseded/duplicate content confirmed, no manifest impact)\",
                :agent-d-ghosthacker-component-inventory \"~45-50% of apps/web/src/components/Storyboard/* (19 components) is generic manga-engine-shaped (komawari-style panel layout templates in manga-layouts.ts, bubble/SFX drag-positioning duplicated across 4 files, kindle/webtoon/manga-page multi-page rendering strategies) vs ~50-55% ghosthacker-specific (episode/character data flow, routing, chat-agent workflow)\",
                :deps-edn-verification \"app-aozora (60-apps/appview/cljs/deps.edn) already sources kami-genko, manga-viewer, kotobase-client, i18n, shitsuke, canvaskit, kotoba-protocol, atprotocol, org-signal, kotobase-messenger as real dependencies, AND already uses reagent+re-frame as its UI framework. ai-gftd-mangaka/clj/deps.edn depends on kotoba-lang langgraph/comfyui/langchain/langgraph-store/kami-engine-sdk/kami-mangaka-expression, only cloud-murakumo (GPU fleet dispatch) is legitimately gftdcojp-tier. BUT komawari layout is NOT commonized: kotoba-lang/kami-mangaka-page holds a stale, currently-broken (missing kami-mangaka-text dep) template-grid port of the OLD mangaka.gftd.ai algorithm, while the actually-live golden-ratio/beat-weight algorithm (ADR-2607051520/2607051530) sits un-extracted inside gftdcojp/ai-gftd-mangaka/clj/src/mangaka/layout/komawari.cljc, which does not depend on kami-mangaka-page at all\",
                :onboarding-mechanics \"halfgram/zankyo/yamainu (ADR-2607120900) never actually gained studio editing capability -- only a work.edn + episodes/*.md repo + west registration. Real studio wiring (work-actors vector in manga_actors.cljc, manga-tx-path hardcoded case in yoro_ui.kotoba.manga, genko canvas keyed by work-actor CACAO identity) is hand-edited per-work, no data-driven registration CLI exists. manga-tx-path ALREADY has a 'ghosthacker' branch (from a prior app-aozora-svelte export) -- ghosthacker is in some sense already partially onboarded, but that tx.edn likely drifted from ghosthacker's live episode.edn, source-of-truth unresolved\",
                :data-model-gap \"ghosthacker's :gh/* namespaced EDN (episode.edn, character profile.edn with personality/neurodiversity/family-history fields, multi-version :gh/generatedImages) is deeply nested vs aozora's flat {:id :title :pages [{:panels [{:visual :imageUrl :dialogue}]}]} tx model -- needs a real translation layer, not a light adapter; character-bible data has no aozora-side analog at all\"},
    :decision {:reject \"full Svelte -> reagent/re-frame wholesale rewrite of apps/web -- contradicts both ADR-2607131400 and the established cljc-SSoT-delegation migration pattern used twice already in this monorepo\",
               :direction \"consolidate ghosthacker's manga-EDITING functionality toward aozora.app/studio (the workspace's actual canonical, already-reagent/re-frame, already-kotoba-lang-commons-heavy editor), rather than reimplementing a fourth/parallel manga engine in ghosthacker itself\",
               :prerequisite \"commonize komawari properly first: port ai-gftd-mangaka's golden-ratio algorithm into kotoba-lang/kami-mangaka-page (superseding its stale template approach), fix its broken kami-mangaka-text dependency, before ghosthacker onboarding proceeds on top of it\"},
    :phases [{:phase 0 :what \"delete 5 orphaned untracked local kami-mangaka-*-clj dirs\" :repos [\"local disk only\"] :blocker \"none, immediately actionable\"}
             {:phase 1 :what \"fix kami-mangaka-text dependency + port golden-ratio komawari algorithm into kami-mangaka-page, superseding old template approach\" :repos [\"kotoba-lang/kami-mangaka-page\" \"kotoba-lang/kami-mangaka-text\"] :blocker \"none, independent of phase 0\"}
             {:phase 2 :what \"rewire ai-gftd-mangaka and app-aozora to depend on kami-mangaka-page for real instead of ai-gftd-mangaka's embedded copy\" :repos [\"gftdcojp/ai-gftd-mangaka\" \"gftdcojp/app-aozora\"] :blocker \"phase 1 complete\"}
             {:phase 3 :what \"build ghosthacker data-translation layer, resolve tx.edn vs episode.edn source-of-truth, verify/update work-actor + manga-tx-path registration\" :repos [\"com-junkawasaki/ghosthacker\" \"gftdcojp/app-aozora\"] :blocker \"phase 2 complete + owner sign-off on open questions below\"}
             {:phase 4 :what \"retire ghosthacker's own generic manga-engine Svelte components (MangaPage/MangaPanel/KindleView/WebtoonView/manga-layouts.ts); keep only ghosthacker-specific chat-agent + data-ownership code, its cljs fate is a separate future decision\" :repos [\"com-junkawasaki/ghosthacker\"] :blocker \"phase 3 complete + studio-side edit/view verified working\"}]
    :open-questions [\"ghosthacker character-bible/_vectors data has no aozora schema analog -- extend aozora's schema to carry it, or intentionally drop it (nothing downstream consumes it today)?\"
                      \"generalize work-actors vector + manga-tx-path hardcoded case to data-driven registration as part of this onboarding, or accept adding/updating ghosthacker's existing hardcoded branch (matching the halfgram/zankyo/yamainu non-precedent)?\"
                      \"komawari geometry (:rect) isn't persisted through genko_tx.cljc today -- is panel-layout fidelity to ghosthacker's ~45 existing arc0-1 pages in scope for this migration, or deferred?\"
                      \"which is source of truth going forward: the existing (possibly stale) ghosthacker-manga-tx.edn from a prior app-aozora-svelte export, or ghosthacker's live episode.edn?\"]}"
  :adr/addenda []}]
